SUMMARY:🎶 SOLA SHOP CONCERT: Paul Daigle & Cajun Gold! 🎻🔥
LOCATION:100 E Vermilion St\, Ste 102\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:Paul Daigle & Cajun Gold Trio\nA celebrated name in traditional
  Cajun music\, Paul Daigle is best known for his work with Paul Daigle\, R
 obert Elkins & Cajun Gold\, a band recognized for its authentic Cajun soun
 d and dedication to preserving French music. With his distinctive accordio
 n playing and vocals\, Daigle has long been a respected figure in the Caju
 n music community.\nFor this special trio performance\, Daigle joins talen
 ted Cajun musicians Mark Latiolais and Cameron Fontenot\, bringing togethe
 r three musicians who share a passion for Acadiana's rich musical heritage
 . The group will play the tunes Pierre Varmon Daigle created for Cajun Gol
 d and recorded\, as well as talk about the stories behind the music and th
 e band.\n\nhttps://happeningnext.com/event/sola-shop-concert-paul-daigle-a
 ndamp-cajun-gold-eid3a0ed9q77d
